  "changed_since_previous": "Added a commit removing unused includes from src/test/util_tests.cpp based on review feedback and include-what-you-use output.",
  "card": "This PR introduces AssertUnreachable() to mark unreachable code and replaces falsy assertion patterns (assert(false) and Assert(false)) across the codebase, enforced via a new linter. It eliminates compiler -Wreturn-type and unreachable code warnings across GCC and clang-cl while avoiding the undefined behavior of C++23 std::unreachable(). Importance is supported by Compiler Explorer reproducers demonstrating compiler warnings with the existing assertion macros. It has no dependencies.",
